# ---- Secrets. Nothing credential-shaped ever lands in this repo. ----
# The real target list holds third-party contact addresses, including named
# individuals at real organisations. The repo is shared with hackathon judges, so it
# ships config/targets.example.csv instead and the loader falls back to it.
config/targets.csv
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials/
secrets/
*-key.json
*_key.json
service-account*.json
client_secret*.json
oauth_client*.json
token.json
tokens.json
*.pem
*.p12
gcp-key*.json

